# Starter terminology for a developer-documentation page (en -> zh).
# Lines starting with # are ignored. `source_lang`/`target_lang` may be omitted
# to apply to every pair. Keep entries specific: a term is only injected when it
# matches as a word, never inside an identifier (`playable-agent`, `worker.py`).
# Measured on Hy-MT2-1.8B-4bit over 46 real doc sentences: unpinned, `agent`
# came back as {agent, 代理, 智能体} and `worker` as {工作根模块, 浏览器进程, 工作程序}
# across sentences; with these entries the rendering is stable per term.
